# Workspace-root .gitignore: everything is ignored EXCEPT the app source.
# The nested kaitan_app/.gitignore still governs the Flutter project's own
# per-file ignores; this file only controls what is visible at the root.

# Ignore everything at the root by default
/*

# Then re-include the things we DO want tracked
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/kaitan_app/
# docs/ is deliberately NOT re-included. It holds internal specifications,
# the implementation plan and 見積書_快単_Phase2.docx — pricing and payment
# terms. None of it is needed to build or ship the app, and this repository
# is public.
